| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach os, owner, empty [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Ignore values ###```
| eval os = if(in(os, "null", "none", "unknown"), null(), os) owner = if(in(owner, "say \"hi\"", "<b>&", "it's"), null(), owner)
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a")
| search _key=*
```### Sort newest first (multivalue fields keep their most recent values) ###```
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, latest(_time) as _time, list(os) as os, list(owner) as owner, list(empty) as empty by _key
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, list(os) as os, list(owner) as owner, list(empty) as empty by _key
```### De-duplicate multivalue fields (order is kept) ###```
| eval os = mvdedup(os), owner = mvdedup(owner), empty = mvdedup(empty)
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval os = mvindex(os,0,4), owner = mvindex(owner,0,4), empty = mvindex(empty,0,4)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, os, owner, empty
| outputlookup assetdb
